===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*starati}}. Cognate with {{cog|uk|стара́тися}}, {{cog|be|стара́цца}}, {{cog|bg|старая|стара́я се}}, {{cog|sh|старати|ста̏рати се|to [[try]] to [[achieve]]; to [[try]]}} (1sg. {{m|sh|ста̏ра̄м се}}), {{cog/sl-tonal|stȃrati se}}, {{cog|cs|starat|starat se}}, {{cog|sk|starať|starať sa}}, {{cog|pl|starać|starać się}}, {{cog|hsb|starać|starać so}}, {{cog|dsb|staraś|staraś se}}. Related to {{cog|ru|страда́||[[harvest]]}} (originally "hard work"), {{m|ru|страда́ть||to [[suffer]]}}. More distantly cognate with {{cog|lt|starìnti||to [[pull]] with [[difficulty]]}} (1sg. {{m|lt|starinù}}), {{cog|lv|starîgs||[[zealous]]}}, {{cog|prg|stūrnawiskan|g=f|pos=ins. sg.||[[seriousness]], [[importance]]}}, {{cog|ang|stierne||[[serious]], [[strict]]}}, {{cog|la|sternāx||[[absurd]]}}, {{m|la|strēnuus||[[active]]}} (also per Vasmer {{m|la|cōnsternō||to [[shake]]}}, inf. {{m|la|cōnsternāre}}, not {{m|la|cōnsternere}}, which is a different verb), {{cog|grc|στρηνής||[[hard]], [[sharp]]}}, {{m|grc|στρῆνος||[[force]]}}, {{cog|cy|trîn||[[fight]], [[work]]}} (from {{cog|cel-pro|*strēnā}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|стара́ться}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-стараться.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|стара́ться|impf|pf=постара́ться|vn=стара́ние<q:nomen actionis>,стара́тель<q:nomen agentis>}}

# to [[try]], to [[attempt]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[я|Я]] '''стара́юсь''' [[ду́мать]] [[о]] [[другой|други́х]] [[хороший|хоро́ших]] [[фильм|фи́льмах]].|I'm trying to think of other good movies.}}
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1905|author=w:ru:Фёдор Сологуб<t:{{w|Fyodor Sologub}}>
|title=w:ru:Мелкий бес|chapter=XX|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=John Cournos and Richard Aldington|title2=w:en:[[The Petty Demon|The Little Demon]]|location2=New York|publisher2=w:en:Alfred A. Knopf|year2=1916|page2=|pageurl2=
|text=Они́ шепта́лись, '''стара́лись''' спря́таться от Передо́нова и тихо́нько ле́зли к нему́ под поду́шку.|t=They whispered to each other, '''tried''' to hide from Peredonov, and stealthily crept towards him under the pillow.}}
# to [[endeavour]]/[[endeavor]], to [[make an effort]]
# to [[pursue]]
# to [[strive]]

====Usage notes====
* {{m|ru|стара́ться}} refers to a continued effort of trying (synonym: [[пытаться]] / [[попытаться]]), as opposed to a single attempt. For the act of trying a single time, see {{m|ru|про́бовать}}.

